{"verse_key": "14:36", "surah": 14, "verse": 36, "text_uthmani": "رَبِّ إِنَّهُنَّ أَضْلَلْنَ كَثِيرًا مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ ۖ فَمَن تَبِعَنِى فَإِنَّهُۥ مِنِّى ۖ وَمَنْ عَصَانِى فَإِنَّكَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ", "translation": "My Lord, indeed they have led astray many among the people. So whoever follows me - then he is of me;<sup foot_note=196578>1</sup> and whoever disobeys me - indeed, You are [yet] Forgiving and Merciful.", "verse_from_ms": 771990, "verse_to_ms": 809680, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/14.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "رَبِّ", "start_ms": 771990, "end_ms": 772700}, {"i": 1, "text": "إِنَّهُنَّ", "start_ms": 772700, "end_ms": 774600}, {"i": 2, "text": "أَضْلَلْنَ", "start_ms": 774600, "end_ms": 778180}, {"i": 3, "text": "كَثِيرًا", "start_ms": 778180, "end_ms": 780820}, {"i": 4, "text": "مِّنَ", "start_ms": 780820, "end_ms": 787590}, {"i": 5, "text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "start_ms": 787590, "end_ms": 788570}, {"i": 6, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 788570, "end_ms": 789140}, {"i": 7, "text": "فَمَن", "start_ms": 789140, "end_ms": 791800}, {"i": 8, "text": "تَبِعَنِى", "start_ms": 791800, "end_ms": 792300}, {"i": 9, "text": "فَإِنَّهُۥ", "start_ms": 792300, "end_ms": 796590}, {"i": 10, "text": "مِنِّى", "start_ms": 796590, "end_ms": 797380}, {"i": 11, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 797380, "end_ms": 798780}, {"i": 12, "text": "وَمَنْ", "start_ms": 798780, "end_ms": 799080}, {"i": 13, "text": "عَصَانِى", "start_ms": 799080, "end_ms": 803479}, {"i": 14, "text": "فَإِنَّكَ", "start_ms": 803480, "end_ms": 804250}, {"i": 15, "text": "غَفُورٌ", "start_ms": 804250, "end_ms": 807590}, {"i": 16, "text": "رَّحِيمٌ", "start_ms": 807590, "end_ms": 809525}]}